  letterDelay: 0.075
  displayDelayAfterWriten: 4
  dialougeText:
  - I kind of feel funny...
  - Maybe I should stop drinking mana potions made using the furnace?
  - What's this?! I'm shrinking!
  - 'Okay, okay, no panic!

    All I need are the <color=Yellow>3 key components</color>
    for the antidote! and then gather them all up in the <color=yellow>Transfigurator</color>

'
  - The <color=Yellow>formulas</color> and <color=Yellow>ingredients</color> have
    to be around here, somewhere!
  isTutorialLevel: 0
  isTyping: 0
  endAfterFinished: 0
